{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":13.44},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":14.64,"end":28.48},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":29.88,"end":40.8}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":3.2,"text":"擾動可以改變起始族群或資源供應。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":3.6,"end":7.52,"text":"用相同時間範圍比較基準與一個改變條件。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":8.16,"end":10.88,"text":"短暫回升不一定代表長期穩定，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":11.173,"end":13.44,"text":"因此要檢查整段軌跡。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":14.64,"end":17.12,"text":"除了把捕食者從 8 增到 16，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":17.52,"end":19.2,"text":"其他基準輸入不變。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":19.76,"end":21.12,"text":"比較獵物反應，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":21.24,"end":24.08,"text":"再還原基準才進行容量實驗。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":25.48,"end":28.48,"text":"不同擾動之間為何要還原基準？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":29.88,"end":32.8,"text":"不同擾動之間為何要還原基準？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":33.84,"end":37.6,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":38.24,"end":40.8,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}